(44819,0,0,'Winds of the south, rise and come to your master\'s aid!',14,0,0,0,0,20227,'boss_siamat - SAY_AGGRO'),
(44819,1,0,'Cower before the tempest storm!',14,0,0,0,0,20228,'boss_siamat - SAY_WAILING_WINDS'),
(44819,1,1,'Suffer the storm!',14,0,0,0,0,20229,'boss_siamat - SAY_WAILING_WINDS 2'),
(44819,2,0,'Nothing more than dust in the wind.',14,0,0,0,0,20232,'boss_siamat - SAY_DEATH'),
(44819,3,0,'The sky... Beckons...',14,0,0,0,0,20226,'boss_siamat - SAY_KILL_PLAYER'),
(44819,4,0,'I. AM. UNLEASHED!',14,0,0,0,0,20231,'boss_siamat - YELL_FREE'),
(45006,0,0,'I hope you have a strong stomach.  Travelling through the breach is not for the weak.',12,0,100,0,0,22606,''),
(45006,1,0,'We\'re at the center of the Maelstrom, the rift between Deepholm and Azeroth.  Watch as it threatens to tear your world apart!',12,0,100,0,0,22607,''),
(45006,2,0,'Let us hope Thrall and the others can contain it while you\'re inside.',12,0,100,0,0,22608,''),
(45006,3,0,'This is it!  Brace yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,22609,''),
(45006,4,0,'You made it!  Good!',12,0,100,4,0,22610,''),
(45006,5,0,'This is the Temple of Earth.  It\'s the most important structure in Deepholm.',12,0,100,0,0,22611,''),
(45006,6,0,'There was once a Titan-made stone inside.  It was known as the World Pillar.  The name was literal.  It bore the weight of all the elemental and magnetic forces in Deepholm.',12,0,100,0,0,22612,''),
(45006,7,0,'It was shattered when Deathwing broke through the dome above and created the rift between the two worlds.  All of Deepholm is going to collapse into Azeroth if we do not put the World Pillar back together.',12,0,100,0,0,22613,''),
(45006,8,0,'The first fragment was going to be delivered to us by a Horde gunship known as the Storm\'s Fury.  It never made it here.',12,0,100,0,0,22614,''),
(45006,9,0,'We\'ve taken control of the temple and we\'re containing as much of the damage as we can.  Go inside and speak to Maruut; he\'s in charge.',12,0,100,0,0,22615,''),
(45006,10,0,'We are all counting on you.',12,0,100,0,0,22616,''),
(45213,0,0,'We were fools to entrust an imbecile like Cho\'gall with such a sacred duty! I will deal with you intruders myself!',14,0,0,0,0,20199,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Aggro01'),
(45213,1,0,'Deathwing!  I have fallen....  The brood... is lost.',14,0,0,0,0,20200,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Death01'),
(45213,2,0,'My brood will feed on your bones!',14,0,0,0,0,20201,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Kill01'),
(45213,2,1,'Powerless....',14,0,0,0,0,20202,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Kill02'),
(45213,3,0,'You mistake this for weakness?  Fool!',14,0,0,0,0,20203,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Losing01'),
(45213,4,0,'I tire of this.  Do you see this clutch amidst which you stand?  I have nurtured the spark within them, but that life-force is and always will be mine.  Behold, power beyond your comprehension!',14,0,0,0,0,20204,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Phase01'),
(45213,5,0,'Enough!  Drawing upon this source will set us back months.  You should feel honored to be worthy of its expenditure.  Now... die!',14,0,0,0,0,20206,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Phase03'),
(45213,6,0,'Feed, children!  Take your fill from their meaty husks!',14,0,0,0,0,20207,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec01'),
(45213,7,0,'The energy infused within my clutch is mine to reclaim!',14,0,0,0,0,20208,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec02'),
(45213,8,0,'Suffer!',14,0,0,0,0,20209,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec03'),
(45213,9,0,'Feel my hatred!',14,0,0,0,0,20210,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec04'),
(45213,10,0,'Come forth, children of twilight....',14,0,0,0,0,20211,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec05'),
(45213,11,0,'Your mother calls!',14,0,0,0,0,20212,'VO_BT_Sinestra_Spec06'),
(45870,0,0,'It shall be I that earns the favor of our lord by casting out the intruders. My calmest wind shall still prove too much for them!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_AGGRO'),
(45870,1,0,'Begone, outsider!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_KILL'),
(45870,1,1,'Your presence shall no longer defile our home!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_KILL'),
(45870,2,0,'My power grows feeble, brothers. I shamefully must rely on you for a time.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_LOW'),
(45870,3,0,'You think to outrun the wind? A fatal mistake.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_ENRAGE'),
(45870,4,0,'The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_ULTIMATE'),
(45870,5,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_GATHER_TWO'),
(45870,6,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ANSHAL_GATHER_ONE'),
(45870,7,0,'The Conclave of Wind is nearing full strength!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Anshal - SAY_ULTIMATE_ANNOUNCE'),
(45871,0,0,'The honor of slaying the interlopers shall be mine, brothers! Their feeble bodies will freeze solid from my wind\'s icy chill!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_AGGRO'),
(45871,1,0,'Frozen solid.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_KILL'),
(45871,1,1,'Another mortal has taken their last breath!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_KILL'),
(45871,2,0,'Brothers, beware! These mortals are dangerous. I must pause and gather my strength.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_LOW'),
(45871,3,0,'You throw away your honor and flee as cowards? Then die!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_ENRAGE'),
(45871,4,0,'The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_ULTIMATE'),
(45871,5,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_GATHER_TWO'),
(45871,6,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Nezir - SAY_NEZIR_GATHER_ONE'),
(45872,0,0,'As I am the strongest wind, it shall be I that tears the invaders apart!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_AGGRO'),
(45872,1,0,'Mere dust...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_KILL'),
(45872,1,1,'Blown away!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_KILL'),
(45872,2,0,'The intruders stand fast, brothers, I cannot break them. Allow me a brief respite to strengthen my winds.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_LOW'),
(45872,3,0,'Why do you flee, mortals? There is nowhere you can run or hide here!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_ENRAGE'),
(45872,4,0,'The power of our winds, UNLEASHED!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_ULTIMATE'),
(45872,5,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_GATHER_TWO'),
(45872,6,0,'%s begins to gather strength from the remaining Wind Lords!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Rohash - SAY_ROHASH_GATHER_ONE'),
(45992,0,0,'Do as the master commands, Theralion! Kill them!',14,0,0,0,0,21894,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event01'),
(45992,1,0,'You are worthless, Theralion!',14,0,0,0,0,21895,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event02'),
(45992,2,0,'Breathe your dying breath!',14,0,0,0,0,21896,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event03'),
(45992,3,0,'At least... Theralion dies with me...',14,0,0,0,0,21897,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event04'),
(45992,4,0,'Theralion, I will engulf the hallway. Cover their escape!',14,0,0,0,0,21898,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event05'),
(45992,5,0,'Enter Twilight!',14,0,0,0,0,21899,'VO_BT_Valiona_Event06'),
(45993,0,0,'The master was clearly speaking to you, Valiona. I am far too busy to attack ANYONE.',14,0,0,0,0,20300,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event01'),
(45993,1,0,'How dare you call me worthless! You will see why I am mother\'s favored child!',14,0,0,0,0,20301,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event02'),
(45993,2,0,'Bare your soul to me, mortal.',14,0,0,0,0,20302,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event03'),
(45993,3,0,'I knew I should have stayed out of this...',14,0,0,0,0,20303,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event04'),
(45993,4,0,'You are not the boss of me, Valiona! I will engulf as I please!',14,0,0,0,0,20304,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event05'),
(45993,4,1,'There is no escape from the fury of the twilight flight!',14,0,0,0,0,20305,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event06'),
(45993,5,0,'WRITHE IN AGONY!',14,0,0,0,0,20306,'VO_BT_Theralion_Event07'),
(46753,0,0,'The Conclave of Wind has dissipated. Your honorable conduct and determination have earned you the right to face me in battle, mortals. I await your assault on my platform! Come!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_AGGRO'),
(46753,1,0,'Your challenge is accepted, mortals! Know that you face Al\'Akir, Elemental Lord of Air! You have no hope of defeating me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_AGGRO'),
(46753,2,0,'Winds! Obey my command!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_WIND_BURST'),
(46753,3,0,'Your futile persistance angers me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_PHASE_2'),
(46753,4,0,'Storms! I summon you to my side!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_STORMLING'),
(46753,5,0,'Enough! I will no longer be contained!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_PHASE_3'),
(46753,6,0,'Like swatting insects...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_KILL'),
(46753,6,1,'This little one shall vex me no longer.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_KILL 2'),
(46753,7,0,'Enough! I tire of these games!',14,0,100,0,0,17011,'AlAkir - SAY_BERSERK'),
(46753,8,0,'After every storm, comes the calm...',14,0,100,0,0,0,'AlAkir - SAY_DEFEAT'),
(49045,0,0,'Augh appears from the distance!',16,0,0,0,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_INTRO_1'),
(49045,1,0,'GAAAH! How you kill croc?!',14,0,0,53,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_HOW_YOU_KILL_CROCK'),
(49045,2,0,'Augh smart! Augh already steal treasure while you no looking! ',14,0,0,1,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_AUGH_SMART'),
(49045,3,0,'Augh da boss! Oh yeah!',14,0,0,1,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_AUGH_BOSS'),
(49045,4,0,'Augh steal your treasure. Uhn uhn uhnnn!',14,0,0,1,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_AUGH_STEAL'),
(49045,5,0,'Who bad?! Augh bad!! Ugn!',14,0,0,1,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_AUGH_BAD'),
(49045,6,0,'Gwaaaaaaahhh!!!',14,0,0,53,0,0,'boss_augh - AUGH_SAY_AAA'),
