(56541,0,0,'You!  You have allowed the Sha to reawaken after all these years!',14,0,100,0,0,27626,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,1,0,'If you truly wish to undo what your kind have wrought upon our land you must first prove yourselves here in our school.',14,0,100,0,0,27627,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,2,0,'First, you will face our initiates...',14,0,100,0,0,27632,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,3,0,'You have bested our most junior of students.  Now you will face two of my most senior.',14,0,100,0,0,27631,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,4,0,'Flying Snow!  Fragrant Lotus!  Step forward!',14,0,100,0,0,27636,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,5,0,'You have bested my prize students. Perhaps you can be of use to us after all...',14,0,100,0,0,27633,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,6,0,'As my master once said, "You cannot truly know someone until you fight them."',14,0,100,0,0,27634,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,7,0,'Come forward, so that we may be properly introduced.',14,0,100,0,0,27635,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,8,0,'Very well then, outsiders. Let us see your true strength.',14,0,100,0,0,27628,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,9,0,'I am bested.  Give me a moment and we will venture forth together to face the Sha.',14,0,100,0,0,27623,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,10,0,'You need more training!',14,0,100,0,0,27637,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,10,1,'Your technique needs work.',14,0,100,0,0,27638,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,11,0,'Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one\'s martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!',14,0,100,0,0,27629,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,12,0,'When I was but a cub I could scarcely throw a punch, but after years of training I can do so much more!',14,0,100,0,0,27630,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,13,0,'Where one falls, another will rise to take their place.',14,0,100,0,0,27624,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56541,13,1,'You have much to learn if you wish to defend your people from the Sha initiate.  Stand aside for your fellow students!',14,0,100,0,0,27625,'Master Snowdrift'),
(56630,0,0,'Then truly, we are lost.',12,0,100,66,0,26503,''),
(56630,1,0,'The ritual will take much from us, as it requires a very piece of our being. We will be weakened greatly.',12,0,100,1,0,26504,''),
(56630,2,0,'They... are my clutch no longer.  Bring them down.',12,0,100,18,0,26505,''),
(56630,3,0,'Take heart, heroes, life will always blossom from the darkest soil!',14,0,100,0,0,26506,''),
(56630,4,0,'They have failed us sister.',12,0,100,18,0,0,''),
(56630,5,0,'It is done! Our power now resides within the Dragon Soul! Our fate lies with you, Earth-Warder!',12,0,100,0,0,26507,''),
(56630,6,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_01.blp:20|t Alexstrasza summons forth the |cFFFF0000|Hspell:105896|h[Gift of Life]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(56664,0,0,'Not necessarily. I believe...yes...it just might work.',12,0,100,5,0,26547,'kalecgos open portal 1'),
(56664,1,0,'The Focusing Iris within the Eye of Eternity may allow us to converge the magical matrix contained within the Dragon Soul.',12,0,100,5,0,26265,'kalecgos open portal 2'),
(56664,2,0,'Then I will open the way into the Eye of Eternity. You must not fail, heroes. The future of Azeroth hinges on your actions.',12,0,100,1,0,26266,'kalecgos open portal 3'),
(56664,3,0,'Excellent! We will begin the ritual at once!',12,0,100,5,0,26262,'kalecgos - event'),
(56664,4,0,'Winds of the arcane be at their backs, and refresh them in this hour of darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,26267,'kalecgos - help'),
(56664,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_blue.blp:20|t Kalecgos summons forth the |cFF0000FF|Hspell:105903|h[Source of Magic]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Kalecgos - Source of Magic'),
(56665,0,0,'I sense danger...it is a trap...carefully laid for us at this crucial moment.',12,0,100,6,0,26147,''),
(56665,1,0,'Praise the Titans, they have returned!',12,0,100,4,0,26145,''),
(56665,2,0,'I sense a great disturbance in the balance approaching. The chaos of it burns my mind!',12,0,100,0,0,26148,''),
(56665,3,0,'In dreams, we may overcome any obstacle!',14,0,100,0,0,26149,''),
(56665,4,0,'I have awakened only to sleep once again.',12,0,100,18,0,0,''),
(56665,5,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_green.blp:20|t Ysera summons forth the |cFF00CC00|Hspell:105900|h[Essence of Dreams]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(56666,0,0,'Not entirely unexpected.',12,0,100,274,0,25953,''),
(56666,1,0,'The cycle of time brings an end to all things.',14,0,100,0,0,25954,''),
(56666,2,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_bronze.blp:20|t Nozdormu imbues you with a |cFFFFFF00|Hspell:105984|h[Timeloop]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(56667,0,0,'It is no use, the power of the Soul is too great. I cannot wield it safely; the raging forces within it may be the doom of us all.',12,0,100,1,0,25904,'thrall open portal 1'),
(56667,1,0,'Yes, I see.  We can finally turn Deathwing\'s own power back against him.',12,0,100,1,0,25905,'thrall open portal 2'),
(56667,2,0,'We have no choice.  We must have faith in our allies.',12,0,100,1,0,25906,'thrall open portal 2'),
(56667,3,0,'Heroes, this burden falls to you once again.',12,0,100,1,0,25898,'thrall - event 1'),
(56667,4,0,'You must protect us from Deathwing\'s forces while we imbue the Dragon Soul with the power of the Aspects.',12,0,100,0,0,25899,'thrall - event 2'),
(56667,5,0,'Speak to me when you are ready to begin.',12,0,100,0,0,25900,'thrall - event 3'),
(56667,6,0,'Strength of the Earth, hear my call! Shield them in this dark hour, the last defenders of Azeroth!',14,0,100,0,0,25907,'thrall - start'),
(56667,7,0,'Taretha...  Cairne...  Aggra...  I will not fail you.  I will not fail this world!',12,0,100,0,0,25908,'thrall - start'),
(56667,8,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_head_dragon_black.blp:20|t Thrall imbues the tanks with the strength of the earth! You are the |cFF9900CC|Hspell:106218|h[Last Defender of Azeroth]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Thrall - last defender of atheroth'),
(56719,0,0,'I will not be caged again. These Shado-Pan could not stop me. Neither shall you!',14,0,100,0,0,28346,'Sha of Violence'),
(56719,1,0,'So long as violence lurks in your hearts... I... will... return...',14,0,100,0,0,28347,'Sha of Violence'),
(56719,2,0,'Another violent death...',14,0,100,0,0,28348,'Sha of Violence'),
(56846,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\ability_warrior_bloodnova.blp:20|tThe %s is injured and sprouts |cFFFE9A2EBlistering Tentacles|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Madness of Deathwing - Blistering Tentacles'),
(56846,10,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_fire_moltenblood.blp:20|t%s begins to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:105863|h[Hemorrhage]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Madness of Deathwing - Hemorrhage'),
(56884,0,0,'Taran Zhu and the Shado-Pan are MINE. Come forward and die by my hand, as all who oppose me shall in the days to come!',14,0,100,0,0,28334,'Corrupted Taran Zhu'),
(56884,1,0,'Hatred will consume and conquer all!',14,0,100,0,0,28332,'Corrupted Taran Zhu'),
(56884,2,0,'No... NO!',14,0,100,0,0,28333,'Corrupted Taran Zhu'),
(56884,3,0,'Rage at your defeat.',14,0,100,0,0,28335,'Corrupted Taran Zhu'),
(56884,4,0,'The Sha of Hatred has fled my body... and the monastery, as well. I must thank you, strangers. The Shado-Pan are in your debt. Now, there is much work to be done...',14,0,100,0,0,28423,'Corrupted Taran Zhu'),
(57107,0,0,'It is them!',14,0,100,0,0,26030,'woe bronze dragon1 event 1'),
(57107,1,0,'Sister, look! The artifact is surrounded by an aura of darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,26031,'woe bronze dragon1 event 2'),
(57107,2,0,'Heroes! We have been sent by Nozdormu! Quickly, on our backs, we must get you to the Dragon Soul!',14,0,100,0,0,26032,'woe bronze dragon1 event 3'),
(57107,3,0,'The aspects!',14,0,100,0,0,26033,'woe bronze dragon1 event 4'),
(57107,4,0,'The Old Gods protect the Soul!',14,0,100,0,0,26035,'woe bronze dragon1 event 5'),
(57107,5,0,'The link to the portal must be broken! Quickly, to Stormrage!',14,0,100,0,0,26036,'woe bronze dragon1 event 6'),
