(62980,1,0,'The Divine chose us to give mortal voice to Her divine will. We are but the vessel that enacts Her will.',14,0,100,0,0,29301,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_AGGRO'),
(62980,2,0,'We will not give in to the despair of the dark void. If Her will for us is to perish, then it shall be so.',14,0,100,0,0,29302,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_DEATH'),
(62980,3,0,'We are the extension of our Empress\'s will.',14,0,100,0,0,29303,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_1A'),
(62980,4,0,'Ours is but to serve in Her divine name.',14,0,100,0,0,29304,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_1B'),
(62980,5,0,'Never to question, nor to contemplate; we simply act.',14,0,100,0,0,29305,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_1C'),
(62980,6,0,'We fight, toil, and serve so that Her vision for us is made reality.',14,0,100,0,0,29306,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_2'),
(62980,7,0,'Her happiness is our reward, her sorrow our failure.',14,0,100,0,0,29307,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_3'),
(62980,8,0,'We will give our lives for the Empress without hesitation. She is the light, and without Her our lives will be lost to darkness.',14,0,100,0,0,29308,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_IDLE_4'),
(62980,9,0,'Her gifts are many, our gratitude immeasurable.',14,0,100,0,0,29309,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_PHASE_1'),
(62980,10,0,'She tests us. We will not disappoint Her.',14,0,100,0,0,29310,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_PHASE_2'),
(62980,11,0,'We are as unwavering as the amber that shapes our halls. With Her might we will vanquish all who dare intrude upon Her divine home.',14,0,100,0,0,29311,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_PHASE_3'),
(62980,12,0,'The chaff of the world tumbles across our doorstep, driven by fear; Her royal storm will whisk them away.',14,0,100,0,0,29312,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_A_COMBAT'),
(62980,13,0,'They were clearly unworthy of Her divine embrace.',14,0,100,0,0,29313,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_A_DIES'),
(62980,14,0,'They are but the waves crashing upon the mountain of Her divine will. They may rise again and again; but will accomplish nothing.',14,0,100,0,0,29314,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_B_COMBAT'),
(62980,15,0,'We are unfazed. We will stand firm.',14,0,100,0,0,29315,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_B_DIES'),
(62980,16,0,'The Divine challenges us to face these intruders.',14,0,100,0,0,29316,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_C_COMBAT'),
(62980,17,0,'And so it falls to us, Her chosen voice.',14,0,100,0,0,29317,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EVENT_TRASH_C_DIES'),
(62980,18,0,'The Divine will not suffer your taint here, outsider.',14,0,100,0,0,29318,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_SLAY_01'),
(62980,19,0,'Ours is but to serve; yours is but to die.',14,0,100,0,0,29319,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_SLAY_02'),
(62980,20,0,'Behold the voice of Her divine wrath.',14,0,100,0,0,29320,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_EXHALE'),
(62980,21,0,'Through the air we breathe, She strengthens our voice.',14,0,100,0,0,29321,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_INHALE'),
(62980,22,0,'Her will is greater than us all. You will join us or you will perish.',14,0,100,0,0,29322,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_CONVERT'),
(62980,23,0,'Our voice gives form to Her will.',14,0,100,0,0,29323,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_PITCH'),
(62980,24,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok flies to one of his platforms!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_FLY_ANN'),
(62980,25,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok inhales the Pheromones of Zeal!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_INHALE_ZEAL_ANN'),
(62980,26,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_druid_stamedingroar.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122852|h[Inhales]|h|r a large breath!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_INHALE_ANN'),
(62980,27,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\spell_arcane_mindmastery.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok uses his voice to |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122740|h[Convert]|h|r members of the raid to fight on his side!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_CONVERT_ANN'),
(62980,28,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\warrior_disruptingshout.blp:20|tImperial Vizier Zor\'lok shouts with |cFFFF0000|Hspell:122713|h[Force and Verve]|h|r!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'Imperial Vizier Zor\'lok - TALK_FORCE_AND_VERVE_ANN'),
(62988,0,0,'You have my gratitude!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(62989,0,0,'You have my gratitude!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(62990,0,0,'You have my gratitude!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(63256,0,0,'Heyarrrrrrrr!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(63520,0,0,'|TInterface\\Icons\\creatureportrait_bubble.blp:20|t%s casts |cFFFF0000|Hspell:124653|h[Water Shell]|h|r! Use the Water Spouts to pop it!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'lite shield'),
(63811,0,0,'Thanks, $p! I thought I was done for.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'intro'),
(63811,1,0,'I panicked when I saw all those saurok and wrecked my boat.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewing'),
(63812,0,0,'It looks like he\'s just unconscious. I should be able to wake him up.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'aph intro'),
(63818,0,0,'Brewmaster! Bataari scouting parties have been sighted outside the village!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'hiseu intro'),
(63818,1,0,'A Warbringer approaches! Fall back!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'hiseu qobi intro'),
(64562,0,0,'Here we go. Do try to keep yourselves alive until the end.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,1,0,'We\'re coming for you, Chillheart! Time for payback!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,2,0,'The Talking Skull cackles gleefully as the instructor\'s soul is destroyed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,3,0,'The Talking Skull seems hesitant to enter the hall, but proceeds with you nonetheless.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,4,0,'I can\'t bear to watch.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,5,0,'The Talking Skull proceeds into the next chamber without saying a word.',16,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,6,0,'Die, Gandling! Kill him!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,7,0,'NO! Get back here coward!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,8,0,'Let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,9,0,'There he is! Kill him now, $p!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,10,0,'Stop him! Forget about her!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64562,11,0,'PREPARE TO DIE, VILLAIN!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(64727,0,0,'The Horde cannot be allowed to recover the Focusing Iris.  Eliminate what remains of their forces, and I will secure the artifact.',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Jaina - Intro'),
(64727,1,0,'I must attune to the Focusing Iris before transport. Protect me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,'Jaina - 5td chapter Done'),
(64727,2,0,'Your people are despicable cowards, orc. You are nothing more than rabid dogs, and you will be put down!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Jaina - Slain'),
(64727,3,0,'You spit on mercy?  Then you will have NONE.  You want carnage?!  Garrosh will get more blood than EVER he bargained for!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'Jaina - Aggro'),
(64838,1,0,'Destroy the Piles of Corpses to stop the Zombified Corpses!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'INSTANCE_INTRO_ANN'),
(64901,0,0,'Good to see you, $n! Do you have a minute?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster intro'),
(64901,1,0,'That\'s the last of the ingredients! Good work, $p! Now the festival can begin!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster breewing'),
(64901,2,0,'Kieu, Tart, Buzaki toss the ingredients in!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster ingredients'),
(64901,3,0,'Now comes the hard part. Everyone stand back, precision is the key to the perfect Kun-Lai Kicker!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster process'),
(64901,4,0,'Yaungol!? Now!?',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster yaungols'),
(64901,5,0,'They must be after the Kun-Lai Kicker! $p, investigate these sightings and setup the village defenses! They won\'t get my brew without a fight!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster defence 2'),
(64901,6,0,'I\'ll defend the brew until it\'s ready. Then we can use it against these Bataari raiders! Everyone else, get to safety!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster defence 3'),
(64901,7,0,'The Kun-Lai Kicker is finished, $p! Now we can use it to kick some yaungol butt!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster done'),
(64901,8,0,'Good work, $p, you saved the village. We are forever in your debt.',14,0,100,0,0,0,'brewmaster end scenario'),
(65271,0,0,'Someone! Please help!',14,0,100,20,0,0,''),
(65271,1,0,'Many thanks!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(65271,2,0,'The local earth spirit, Hui, is angry that we hired adventurers to drive off his mischievous sprites.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(65271,3,0,'I can understand he\'s upset, but this attack is simply going too far!',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(65295,0,0,'Sisters, the village need our help. Head to the front lines and heal the wounded!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'mistweaver intro'),
(65501,0,0,'Pitiful, wingless grubs. You step out into my domain, and I will hear your death screams as you plummet from this terrace!',14,0,100,0,0,30348,'MELJARAK_INTRO_EVENT_1'),
(65501,1,0,'Set\'thik, in formation! Show them who controls the winds of Pandaria!',14,0,100,0,0,30349,'MELJARAK_INTRO_EVENT_2'),
(65501,2,0,'Breath of the empress, bring mighty Garalon to us!',14,0,100,0,0,30350,'MELJARAK_INTRO_EVENT_SUMMON_GARALON'),
(65501,3,0,'Garalon, grind their bones to dust!',14,0,100,0,0,30351,'MELJARAK_INTRO_EVENT_GARALON_COMBAT'),
(65501,4,0,'Impossible! Sri\'thik, Zar\'thik, Kor\'thik, to the top of the terrace! We must defend the Empress!',14,0,100,0,0,30352,'MELJARAK_INTRO_EVENT_GARALON_DEATH'),
(65590,0,0,'$n stepped on a lightning trap!',41,0,100,0,0,0,'step on lightning trap'),
(67260,0,0,'Now entering the arena: a Rank 1 $r $c, $n! $n is pretty new around here, so go easy!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,1,0,'Now entering the arena: an up-and coming Rank 2 $c, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,2,0,'Put your hands together for $n! $n is a Rank 3 $c.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,3,0,'Here\'s our challenger. Today, we welcome a Rank 4 $r $c, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,4,0,'Now entering the arena, we have a very talented $c. Say hello to $n, a Rank 5 brawler!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,5,0,'Look out... here comes the deadly Rank 6 $r, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,6,0,'Now entering the arena: a returning champion. Our Rank 7 $c, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,7,0,'Now entering the arena: You know $ghim:her;. You love $ghim:her;. Give it up for our Rank 8 Brawler, $N!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,8,0,'$gHe\'s:She\'s; one of our veteran Rank 9 brawlers here in the Brawlpub. It\'s $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,'');
INSERT INTO `tmp_548_creature_text` (`entry`,`groupid`,`id`,`text`,`type`,`language`,`probability`,`emote`,`duration`,`sound`,`comment`) VALUES
(67260,9,0,'Also entering the arena: Bruce, a crocolisk that we found!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,10,0,'In the other corner, we have Vian, the flame-flinging follower of the Thunder King!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,11,0,'Also entering the arena: Goredome! So-named because he will gore you. With his dome.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,12,0,'We also welcome our pain-packing crowd favorite: Dungeon Master Vishas!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,13,0,'We also welcome everybody\'s favorite frosty feathered friend: Dippy!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,14,0,'Also entering the arena: Kirrawk, wind-wielding arakkoa of the Terokkar Forest!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,15,0,'In the other corner... hey look! It\'s my buddy, Fran! And he brought his mount with him!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,16,0,'Now this is what I\'m talking about! More dinosaurs, please! It\'s King Kulaka!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,24,0,'Get ready to dance! Deeken\'s in the house!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,25,0,'Up next, probably the weakest, ugliest, and least genius combatant I\'ve ever seen. It\'s the stupid, smelly gnome, Millie Watt! Everybody boo!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,26,0,'Also entering the arena: Everybody\'s favorite magical 12-foot-tall corpse, Fjoll! Am I pronouncing that right?',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,27,0,'Ha ha ha! What bad luck you have! It\'s Proboskus! Ahhh ha ha ha! I\'ve got twenty five gold that says you die in the fire!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,28,0,'Five on one hardly seems fair, but come on... they\'re half-dead gnomes. It\'s the leper gnome quintet!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,29,0,'We found this one cawing up a storm in Auchindoun. Give it up for Yikkan Izu!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,30,0,'Some of you veterans might remember this fella\'. Sure, he\'s broken, but he means to break you! It\'s Akama!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,31,0,'We also welcome Smash Hoofstomp, the terrible tauren from Thunder Bluff!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,32,0,'Quiet down, everyone... we don\'t want to make it angry. Just gaze in silent awe at Unguloxx, the murderaffe!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,33,0,'Their partnership was never meant to be. It actually makes me sick a little bit. Here comes GG Engineering!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,34,0,'Also entering the arena: The Dark Summoner. Wow, he doesn\'t even have a real name. Spooky!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,35,0,'Also entering the arena: Battletron! Sure, it\'s not goblin-engineered... but it still might kill you!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,36,0,'And... Meatball.',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,37,0,'$n is our victor!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,37,1,'Well well well! $n wins! Looks like I owe someone some money.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,37,2,'Congratulations, $n! Try not to leave any bloody footprints outside of the arena.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,37,3,'It\'s official! $n managed not to die. Great job not dying, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,38,0,'Ouch... sorry, $n. Get back in line and try again.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,38,1,'Yechhh... what a mess. Can we get a priest or something over here?!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,38,2,'That... did not end well.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,38,3,'$n, $n, $n. Next time, try not to die so much.',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67260,39,0,'What\'s this? Bruce is back! A better, faster, stronger Bruce! It\'s MECHA-BRUCE!!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,40,0,'Dust off that luckydo, because you\'re gonna need it. It\'s Grandpa Grumplefloot!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,41,0,'Ever wonder what we do with all our obsolete robots? We send them to their deaths in bloody gladiatorial arenas, of course! Here comes Blingtron 3000!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67260,42,0,'Also entering the arena: the magnanimous Master Boom Boom, the dynamite throwing monkey monk!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(67263,0,0,'The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord calls for help!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67263,1,0,'The Darkhatched Lizard-Lord prepares to unleash a group of Water Jets!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67266,0,0,'Proceed by foot. We\'ll circle around and look for another entrance.',12,0,100,25,0,34419,''),
(67266,1,0,'This is the chamber we\'re looking for.',14,0,100,1,0,34403,''),
(67266,2,0,'The Warchief has learned there\'s a connection between the Mogu and these creatures.',14,0,100,1,0,34404,''),
(67266,3,0,'Troll! You know all about this... voodoo.  What can you find?',14,0,100,25,0,34405,''),
(67266,4,0,'Yes! The power to shape flesh, to build warriors.  This is what the Warchief wants!',14,0,100,5,0,34400,''),
(67266,5,0,'He knew you were a traitor!',14,0,100,5,0,34401,''),
(67266,6,0,'The Warchief will annihilate his enemies!',14,0,100,15,0,34402,''),
(67266,7,0,'Strength!',14,0,100,0,0,34411,''),
(67266,8,0,'Is THIS where your loyalties lie?',14,0,100,0,0,34406,''),
(67266,9,0,'...die!',14,0,100,0,0,34413,''),
(67266,10,0,'Hellscream\'s Horde demands absolute obedience!',14,0,100,0,0,34407,''),
(67266,11,0,'The Warchief will hear of this betrayal!',14,0,100,0,0,34408,''),
(67266,12,0,'Hellscream... will find out...',14,0,100,0,0,34409,''),
(67267,0,0,'Speak with a guard if you wish to fight, $c.',12,0,100,66,0,0,''),
(67267,1,0,'You want to fight?  You\'re gonna need an invite.$b$bYou\'re welcome to watch, though.',12,0,100,6,0,0,''),
(67414,0,0,'Everyone be here now. Let\'s get dis done wit.',12,0,100,0,0,34549,''),
(67414,1,0,'As da Warchief commands...',12,0,100,0,0,34550,''),
(67414,2,0,'I\'m glad you here to watch me back. I don\'t like da look of Garrosh\'s goons.',12,0,100,0,0,34551,''),
(67414,3,0,'Let\'s mount up and move out!',12,0,100,25,0,34552,''),
(67414,4,0,'Scouts say dere\'s ancient magics in dese caves. Warchief wants \'em checked out.',12,0,100,0,0,34553,''),
(67414,5,0,'Dem Saurok be guardin de cave.  Let\'s take care of \'em.',12,0,100,0,0,34554,''),
(67414,6,0,'Lead him inta dis trap!',14,0,100,0,0,34523,''),
(67414,7,0,'Use \'dis to heal yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,34519,''),
(67414,8,0,'Hold up - there\'s somethin\' dere.',14,0,100,0,0,34513,''),
(67414,9,0,'One a dem lizard-beasts. Fight on me bruddahs!',14,0,100,0,0,34515,''),
(67414,10,0,'Have you fought dese \'tings before?',12,0,100,6,0,34526,''),
(67414,11,0,'It\'s like dey got weapons, but no brains.',12,0,100,1,0,34527,''),
(67414,12,0,'One of you man da guns, the rest on foot.',12,0,100,25,0,34528,''),
(67414,13,0,'Kill anyting dat squirms!',12,0,100,0,0,34529,''),
(67414,14,0,'Here! Stop da boat here.',12,0,100,25,0,34532,''),
(67414,15,0,'Dis be some kinda spawnin chamber.',12,0,100,1,0,34534,''),
(67414,16,0,'...And dat be one ugly mudder!',12,0,100,0,0,34535,''),
(67414,17,0,'Be careful! Da roof be comin\' down!',14,0,100,0,0,34536,''),
(67414,18,0,'Run into the Big Bad Voodoo!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67414,19,0,'Somethin unnatural about \'dese creatures.',12,0,100,1,0,34537,''),
(67414,20,0,'"Voodoo"',12,0,100,14,0,34538,''),
(67414,21,0,'Watch me back while I investigate...',12,0,100,1,0,34539,''),
(67414,22,0,'\'Dese "Mogu," dey workin\' wicked dark magic here.',12,0,100,1,0,34508,''),
(67414,23,0,'Da Saurok, \'dey not born - \'dey was created. Flesh shaped an\' bent.',12,0,100,5,0,34509,''),
(67414,24,0,'Dis be the blackest of magics, mon!',12,0,100,274,0,34510,''),
(67414,25,0,'Garrosh playing god? Making monsters? Dis ain\'t what da Horde is about!',12,0,100,274,0,34511,''),
(67414,26,0,'H-help-',12,0,100,0,0,34512,''),
(67414,27,0,'Da... Warchief shows... his hand.',12,0,100,0,0,34540,''),
(67414,28,0,'Dis be what da Horde come to? Killin\' its own? We can\'t let dis happen.',12,0,100,0,0,34541,''),
(67414,29,0,'Champions, I need ya.',12,0,100,0,0,34542,''),
(67414,30,0,'Go back to da Warchief.  Tell \'im I\'m dead. Stay close to \'im. Watch \'im.',12,0,100,0,0,34543,''),
(67414,31,0,'You an\' me, we move to take \'im out when da time is right.',12,0,100,0,0,34544,''),
(67414,32,0,'Others are like me. You gotta find \'em.',12,0,100,0,0,34545,''),
(67414,33,0,'Swear da blood oath wit me.',12,0,100,0,0,34546,''),
(67569,0,0,'Once you have delivered supplies, your work is not done. Do your best to keep our resources topped off.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(67569,1,0,'Look fer brittle roots stickin\' out of the soil. There\'s good wood in \'em!',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(67569,2,0,'Food and wood are our primary needs. Speak with me if you seek to aid us further.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(67686,0,0,'You\'ve gained Mogu Power!  Pick up more runes and your power will grow.',42,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67688,0,0,'This jungle will soon be cleansed of Alliance filth!',14,0,100,30,0,0,''),
(67748,0,0,'A Darkhatched Sorcerer has put the boat into Stasis!  Kill it to interrupt the spell.',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67761,0,0,'A test! A trial of patience. Will the wolf behave as a warrior... or a King?',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(67761,1,0,'A sword is the weapon of a warrior, but patience is the weapon of kings.',12,0,100,1,0,34344,''),
(67761,2,0,'This day brings victory, but more difficult trials lie ahead...',12,0,100,1,0,34345,''),
(67782,0,0,'Hey - wait for me! I don\'t like goons, either.',14,0,100,0,0,34365,''),
(67782,1,0,'We can take this boat inside.  Just let me make a few modifications...',12,0,100,0,0,34356,''),
(67782,2,0,'And...done! A self-propelled saurok slaying machine.',12,0,100,4,0,34357,''),
(67782,3,0,'Ack, get that thing off us!',14,0,100,430,0,34358,''),
(67782,4,0,'Here, take this! It\'ll help you against any swarms.',12,0,100,0,0,34373,''),
(67782,5,0,'I\'ll just ... be right here. Don\'t forget about me!',12,0,100,0,0,34374,''),
(67799,0,0,'$p, report for duty immediately!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'captain intro'),
(67862,0,0,'The statue appears to be of an ancient Mogu emperor.',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67863,0,0,'It seems as though this cave used to contain powerful Mogu magic.',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67879,0,0,'Zan\'vess will never fall!',14,0,100,0,0,0,'telvrak intro'),
(67883,0,0,'Gnome Construction Site Under Attack!',41,0,100,30,0,34768,''),
(67930,0,0,'CARRIER HAS ARRIVED.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(67990,0,0,'I have selected a landing site for our forces: a small peninsula to our east that is easily defended.',12,0,100,0,0,35616,''),
(67990,1,0,'Alas, the Zandalari trolls have already claimed and fortified it.',12,0,100,0,0,35617,''),
(67990,2,0,'They\'re protecting it with a powerful spirit barrier. We will need to disable it before our ships can land.',12,0,100,0,0,35618,''),
(67990,3,0,'Champion, I need you to lead a ground assault and take down that barrier from within!',12,0,100,0,0,35619,''),
(67990,4,0,'Mount up and rendezvous with Scout Captain Elsia. She is organizing an elite group of rangers to accompany you. May the light of the sun shine upon you.',12,0,100,0,0,35620,''),
(67990,5,0,'Victory to the Sin\'dorei! And another triumph for the Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,35621,''),
