(68106,0,0,'$p, we should discuss matters back in Krasarang. For now, thank you for your help. There is a portal that can return you to Lion\'s Landing whenever you choose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,0,0,'Foolish warlocks. I knew you would try again to ransack our temple...!',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,1,0,'Wait... you\'re not one of the warlocks that snuck in here before. Why then are you here?',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,2,0,'It has been many months since those two warlocks broke into the temple... but I\'m still not sure what they were after.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,3,0,'Follow me. They visited both the Shrine of Lost Souls and the Temple Summit.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,4,0,'I have decided to trust this warlock for now. Let $ghim:her; move about the temple freely.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,5,0,'It will take many years for us to undo the damage that Magtheridon, Illidan and the fel orcs did to this holy place.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,6,0,'Within lies the Shrine of Lost Souls. The souls of thousands of my fallen brethren remain within this area.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(68137,7,0,'Use caution, there are many traps still active within. Perhaps one of your demon spells will grant you the ability to scout ahead before advancing forward.',12,0,100,0,0,0,''),
