(68323,3,0,'Here\'s our challenger. Today, we welcome a Rank 4 $r $c, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(68323,4,0,'Now entering the arena, we have a very talented $c. Say hello to $n, a Rank 5 brawler!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(68323,5,0,'Look out... here comes the deadly Rank 6 $r, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(68323,6,0,'Now entering the arena: a returning champion. Our Rank 7 $c, $n!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
(68323,7,0,'Now entering the arena: You know $ghim:her;. You love $ghim:her;. Give it up for our Rank 8 Brawler, $N!!',14,0,100,22,0,0,''),
