(69457,0,0,'I count six... no, seven guards on patrol in the sky.',12,0,100,0,0,35852,''),
(69457,1,0,'One of them flies higher than the others... He loops far out over the water - alone. He is over-extending. That is our in.',12,0,100,0,0,35853,''),
(69457,2,0,'We will neutralize him and take his route. Let\'s go!',12,0,100,0,0,35854,''),
(69457,3,0,'Just a little closer...',12,0,100,0,0,35855,''),
(69457,4,0,'Hyah!',12,0,100,0,0,35856,''),
(69457,5,0,'The Zandalari are more cautious than I thought. Look down there - swarming with patrols.',12,0,100,0,0,35857,''),
(69457,6,0,'And their shamans have laid out a network of sentry totems.',12,0,100,0,0,35859,''),
(69457,7,0,'One of these smoke bombs will blind a sentry totem.',12,0,100,0,0,35861,''),
(69457,8,0,'Clear a path from the ship to the gate at the upper level - we will need to cross on foot.',12,0,100,0,0,35862,''),
(69457,9,0,'We cannot circle up here for long. Do what you can while I plan our next move.',12,0,100,0,0,35863,''),
(69457,10,0,'Our time is up. We need to get aboard that ship.',12,0,100,0,0,35864,''),
