(69485,0,0,'Up here, champion!',12,0,100,0,0,35358,''),
(69485,1,0,'The Sunreavers have devised a way to ward our flying mounts against the lightning. But fly in loose formation, just in case.',12,0,100,0,0,35359,''),
(69485,2,0,'Look below! Our continued assaults on the town and crypts have thrown the enemy into disarray. The mogu and the Zandalari already fear the might of the Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,35360,''),
(69485,3,0,'Do you see the central tower? Lightning strikes it continuously. Aethas suspects that the storms originate from the heart of the palace itself.',12,0,100,0,0,35361,''),
(69485,4,0,'The Thunder King\'s palace lies ahead. We must secure a foothold on the island before we can assault his fortress.',12,0,100,0,0,36373,''),
(69485,5,0,'The other rangers are waiting for us just ahead. Our first priority is - Look out!',12,0,100,0,0,35362,''),
(69485,6,0,'By the sunwell! The skies betray us - we are not safe up here!',12,0,100,0,0,35363,''),
(69485,7,0,'Ugh! Hold on!',12,0,100,0,0,36372,''),
(69485,8,0,'Champion, are you all right?',12,0,100,0,0,35365,''),
(69485,9,0,'We were not safe at all. They were waiting for us. Our forces are scattered throughout the swamp, and we are alone behind enemy lines!',12,0,100,0,0,35366,''),
(69485,10,0,'No. Not good.',12,0,100,0,0,35367,''),
(69485,11,0,'They are pulling back, but we cannot let up now.',12,0,100,0,0,35368,''),
(69485,12,0,'Our only hope of getting out of here alive is to take the town.',12,0,100,0,0,35369,''),
(69485,13,0,'The entrance is barricaded. Break it down!',12,0,100,0,0,35370,''),
(69485,14,0,'Good work, hero. Let\'s move on.',12,0,100,0,0,35378,''),
(69485,15,0,'I do not like the look of that troll. Be careful!',12,0,100,0,0,35371,''),
(69485,16,0,'You make this look easy.',12,0,100,0,0,35380,''),
(69485,17,0,'They are protecting that mask. It must be the source of the barrier. Destroy it!',12,0,100,0,0,35372,''),
(69485,18,0,'The shield - it is down! We did it!',12,0,100,0,0,35376,''),
(69485,19,0,'Champion, without your help I would\'ve died in that swamp. I owe you my very life.',12,0,100,0,0,35377,''),
(69501,0,0,'YOU will kneel when you beg for my mercy, monster.',14,0,100,0,0,35888,''),
(69501,1,0,'Those statues wield the power of the first emperor. Destroy them!',14,0,100,0,0,35889,''),
(69501,2,0,'Taoshi, get those doors open.',12,0,100,0,0,35890,''),
(69501,3,0,'Champion, with me. We must press forward while your comrades cover the rear.',12,0,100,0,0,35891,''),
(69501,4,0,'Shan Bu! Again you try to create a God. When will you learn?',14,0,100,0,0,35892,''),
(69501,5,0,'Zandalari reinforcements are coming.',14,0,100,0,0,35893,''),
(69501,6,0,'Yalia - we need more healing! Taoshi - cover the rear!',14,0,100,0,0,35894,''),
(69501,7,0,'Face me, Shan Bu! Or is the court of the Thunder King a den of cowards?',14,0,100,0,0,35895,''),
(69501,8,0,'Dance around Shan Bu\'s attacks. We are faster! We are smarter!',14,0,100,0,0,35898,''),
(69501,9,0,'Auugh - kill him. Quickly!',14,0,100,0,0,35903,''),
(69501,10,0,'You see? No power of this world can trample the pure of spirit.',12,0,100,0,0,35905,''),
(69501,11,0,'Like children.',12,0,100,0,0,36158,''),
(69501,12,0,'Taoshi! Hand me my weapon.',12,0,100,0,0,36159,''),
(69501,13,0,'My weapon! Champion, with me. I want you to see this.',12,0,100,0,0,35907,''),
(69501,14,0,'ENOUGH!! There will be no more bloodshed today.',14,0,100,0,0,35908,''),
(69501,15,0,'I see now why your Alliance and your Horde cannot stop fighting.',14,0,100,0,0,35909,''),
(69501,16,0,'Every reprisal is itself an act of aggression, and every act of aggression triggers immediate reprisal.',14,0,100,0,0,35910,''),
(69501,17,0,'SILENCE! YOU must break the cycle.',14,0,100,0,0,35911,''),
(69501,18,0,'It ends TODAY. Here. The cycle ends when you, Regent Lord, and you, Lady Proudmoore, turn from one another. And walk. Away.',14,0,100,0,0,35912,''),
(69501,19,0,'Champion, this cease-fire may not last, but remember what you have seen today.',12,0,100,0,0,35913,''),
(69501,20,0,'Shan Bu\'s monstrosity remains at the foot of the palace. It must be stopped before it wreaks havoc across Pandaria.',12,0,100,0,0,35914,''),
(69530,0,0,'Taran Zhu! It does not matter how many you array against the Thunder King. Soon all will kneel before him.',14,0,100,0,0,35769,''),
(69530,1,0,'Who needs a God? We have the Thunder King!',14,0,100,0,0,35770,''),
(69530,2,0,'Trolls - make yourselves useful. I am almost finished here.',14,0,100,0,0,35771,''),
(69530,3,0,'Arise, Nalak! Protect our beloved emperor.',14,0,100,0,0,35772,''),
(69530,4,0,'The emperor will be most pleased when I present him with your head, Shado-Pan.',14,0,100,0,0,35773,''),
(69530,5,0,'Ours is to rule. Yours is to serve!',14,0,100,0,0,35778,''),
(69530,6,0,'I tire of your insolence! I will choke the life from you, impudent slave!',14,0,100,0,0,35779,''),
(69530,7,0,'I ... no... My emperor! My emperor, I have failed you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69538,0,0,'They come! To arms me brothers - hurl them back to the sea!',12,0,100,0,0,35415,''),
(69538,1,0,'You have not seen the full might o\' the Zandalari!',12,0,100,0,0,35416,''),
(69538,2,0,'Hold the ruins. Slay them where they stand!',12,0,100,0,0,35417,''),
(69538,3,0,'Crush the intruders. The barrier must not fall.',12,0,100,0,0,35418,''),
(69544,0,0,'We should sabotage the siege weapons toward the bow. Then we will go below decks and find the captain.',12,0,100,0,0,35868,''),
(69544,1,0,'Easy now... Get in close and incapacitate them.',12,0,100,0,0,35866,''),
(69544,2,0,'Taoshi nods toward the crewman on the right. Sneak up behind him to knock him out!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69544,3,0,'There will be a very unpleasant surprise waiting for the next troll who disturbs these. Let\'s keep moving.',12,0,100,0,0,35867,''),
(69544,4,0,'Taoshi motions at Captain Halu\'kal, then draws a finger across her neck.',41,0,100,25,0,0,''),
(69544,5,0,'Not as quiet as I would prefer, but it works.',12,0,100,0,0,35870,''),
(69544,6,0,'The courtyard gate is directly up that hill.',12,0,100,0,0,35871,''),
(69544,7,0,'Remember to stay clear of those sentry totems.',12,0,100,0,0,35872,''),
(69544,8,0,'Sounds like they found our little present.',12,0,100,0,0,35877,''),
(69544,9,0,'Through you, is it? I think we can manage that.',12,0,100,397,0,35878,''),
(69544,10,0,'Would you prefer we go through the belly, or the ribcage?',12,0,100,45,0,35879,''),
(69544,11,0,'Well fought! Now - the gates. Before the thunder king\'s entire army comes down on us!',12,0,100,0,0,35880,''),
(69544,12,0,'The fighting skills of my companion are quickly becoming legendary among the Shado-Pan.',12,0,100,0,0,35881,''),
(69559,0,0,'FOOLS! I will show you how it is done!',14,0,100,25,0,0,''),
