(69559,2,0,'Well, ya got where you were goin\'. Too bad you\'re not gonna live long enough to see it!',14,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(69559,3,0,'Prepare to die, intrudah!',14,0,100,53,0,0,''),
(69559,4,0,'Horaki readies a Frost Shot!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69559,5,0,'Horaki launches a Hail of Arrows into the sky!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69562,0,0,'I am born of thunder!',14,0,100,0,0,35732,''),
(69565,0,0,'It is chaos out there, $p! The siege has begun but our heavy explosives never made it to the wall.',12,0,100,5,0,36375,''),
(69565,1,0,'I will cover the flanks. Gather up our explosives and get them to the wall. Hurry!',12,0,100,1,0,36376,''),
(69565,2,0,'The charges are placed. Hero - you may have the honor.',12,0,100,1,0,36377,''),
(69565,3,0,'This way - the Zandalari are falling back!',14,0,100,5,0,36379,''),
(69565,4,0,'What... what did they DO to that troll!?',12,0,100,5,0,36381,''),
(69565,5,0,'My Lord Regent - you should not be so close to the front lines.',12,0,100,5,0,36383,''),
(69615,0,0,'Good, you are here.',12,0,100,0,0,36594,''),
(69615,1,0,'Lady Proudmoore! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but...',12,0,100,0,0,36157,''),
(69615,2,0,'The Horde is just across the courtyard.',12,0,100,0,0,35930,''),
(69615,3,0,'Lady Proudmoore - more Zandalari are approaching from the docks.',14,0,100,0,0,35931,''),
(69615,4,0,'They killed my husband!',14,0,100,0,0,35932,''),
(69616,0,0,'But what?',12,0,100,0,0,35499,''),
(69616,1,0,'Of course they are. One problem at a time, Vereesa.',12,0,100,0,0,35500,''),
(69616,2,0,'Everyone! Advance!',14,0,100,0,0,35501,''),
(69616,3,0,'... and if anyone sees that traitor, Aethas Sunreaver, save that one for me...',12,0,100,0,0,35502,''),
(69616,4,0,'Ignore the Horde - focus on the Zandalari guarding the door!',14,0,100,0,0,35503,''),
(69616,5,0,'They\'re trying to flank us. Hold this position!',14,0,100,0,0,35504,''),
(69616,6,0,'Hand over the Archmage and I may yet allow you to walk out of here, Lor\'themar.',14,0,100,0,0,35505,''),
(69616,7,0,'Your people are legitimate prisoners of war. They orchestrated an attack on Darnassus from MY city-',14,0,100,0,0,35506,''),
(69616,8,0,'They have undermined EVERY attempt at peace!',14,0,100,0,0,35507,''),
(69616,9,0,'Very well. We will stand down.',12,0,100,0,0,35509,''),
(69616,10,0,'This won\'t bring him back.',12,0,100,0,0,35508,''),
(69616,11,0,'But know this, "Blood" Elf: There can be no peace while Hellscream is Warchief of the Horde.',12,0,100,0,0,35510,''),
(69616,12,0,'Lord.',12,0,100,0,0,35511,''),
(69616,13,0,'Gather the wounded. Withdraw to the harbor.',14,0,100,0,0,35615,''),
(69617,0,0,'Yes?',12,0,100,0,0,35639,''),
(69617,1,0,'Ahhh, so the grand lady of the Kirin Tor wants a fight, does she?',12,0,100,0,0,35640,''),
(69617,2,0,'Rangers! Advance!',14,0,100,0,0,35641,''),
(69617,3,0,'I will deal with Proudmoore.',14,0,100,0,0,35642,''),
(69617,4,0,'One problem at a time, people. Focus on the Zandalari!',14,0,100,0,0,35643,''),
(69617,5,0,'Proudmoore! You will release my people from the Violet Hold, or I will cut you down myself!',14,0,100,0,0,35608,''),
(69617,6,0,'The Sunreavers knew NOTHING of Garrosh\'s raid on Darnassus!',14,0,100,0,0,35609,''),
(69617,7,0,'I must protect my sovereign people.',14,0,100,0,0,35610,''),
(69617,8,0,'Rangers. Lower your weapons.',12,0,100,0,0,35611,''),
(69617,9,0,'That is precisely why I wish to conserve our strength today.',12,0,100,0,0,35613,''),
(69617,10,0,'Lady.',12,0,100,0,0,35614,''),
(69617,11,0,'Everyone, regroup back at the camp. Our work here is done.',14,0,100,0,0,35512,''),
(69620,0,0,'Good, you are here.',12,0,100,0,0,36156,''),
(69620,1,0,'Regent Lord! Everyone is in position, and the Shado-Pan are inside, but...',12,0,100,0,0,36595,''),
(69620,2,0,'The Alliance is waiting for us just across the courtyard.',12,0,100,0,0,36385,''),
(69621,0,0,'Lord Zhu! The Alliance - the Horde - all chaos is about to erupt out here!',14,0,100,0,0,35820,''),
(69621,1,0,'My Lord... you are gravely wounded!',12,0,100,0,0,35821,''),
(69621,2,0,'Lord Zhu!',14,0,100,0,0,35822,''),
(69621,3,0,'We must get you back to the monastery.',12,0,100,0,0,35823,''),
(69621,4,0,'Yalia, take Lord Zhu to safety.',12,0,100,0,0,35824,''),
(69621,5,0,'Hero, it will be up to you to defeat the Storm Lord Nalak. You will have to marshal a small army!',12,0,100,0,0,35825,''),
(69621,6,0,'But after what I have seen today, I have faith in you.',12,0,100,0,0,35826,''),
(69621,7,0,'It has been a great honor to fight by your side. Thank you.',12,0,100,0,0,35827,''),
(69702,0,0,'Stop them! The Animus must not be disturbed!',14,0,100,0,0,35725,''),
