(69743,0,0,'Awaken, Hu\'seng! The docks are your responsibility. See that none pass his majesty\'s gates.',14,0,100,0,0,35781,''),
(69755,0,0,'Crush them! Bleed them!',14,0,100,0,0,35995,''),
(69755,1,0,'The spirits give us strength!',14,0,100,0,0,35993,''),
(69755,2,0,'Step forward! Witness the gift of the Thunder King!',14,0,100,1,0,35997,''),
(69755,3,0,'I was chosen. My blood burns with his power!',14,0,100,1,0,35998,''),
(69755,4,0,'You will be punished! Your life a lesson in futility!',14,0,100,1,0,36000,''),
(69755,5,0,'For Zandalar!!',14,0,100,1,0,36001,''),
(69756,0,0,'The orb explodes!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(69923,0,0,'What is this? Another uprising?',14,0,100,0,0,35787,''),
(69923,1,0,'Bend before me!',14,0,100,0,0,35791,''),
(69923,2,0,'You will be... punished...',14,0,100,0,0,35788,''),
(70055,0,0,'Cover one another! Stand your ground!',14,0,100,0,0,35625,''),
(70055,1,0,'Spectacular! Move up - press onward. Show them no quarter!',14,0,100,0,0,35632,''),
(70055,2,0,'Rangers - to me! We have broken their lines!',12,0,100,0,0,35633,''),
(70055,3,0,'Nonsense. This is where I belong.',12,0,100,0,0,35634,''),
(70055,4,0,'Champion! Again you are at the forefront of a Horde triumph. And once more I am in your debt.',12,0,100,0,0,35635,''),
(70055,5,0,'Regroup behind the wards, everyone. They will counter-attack... but we will be ready.',12,0,100,0,0,35636,''),
(70056,0,0,'Des fools thought they beat me once before. Dey only make me stronger. Now we show dem da true power of the Zandalari!',14,0,100,11,0,35404,'ToT Garajal Intro 1'),
(70056,1,0,'Let me share dis gift with ya!',14,0,100,11,0,35395,'ToT Garajal Intro 2'),
(70056,2,0,'Da Zandalari cannot be stopped!',14,0,100,11,0,35400,'ToT Garajal Intro 3'),
(70056,3,0,'Wit de Thunder King\'s power de Zandalari will be reborn!',14,0,100,11,0,35401,'ToT Garajal Intro 4'),
(70056,4,0,'De Thunder King will reward us for stoppin\' ya!',14,0,100,11,0,35397,'ToT Garajal Intro End'),
(70061,0,0,'The Thunder Forge has begun to charge an area nearby.  Run into it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:139397|h[Overcharge]|h|r yourself!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70100,0,0,'The trillium you brought me must be refined for our purposes.',12,0,100,1,0,36021,''),
(70100,1,0,'This foundry should be sufficient.  Help me manipulate the molds.',12,0,100,25,0,36022,''),
(70100,2,0,'The Shado-Pan are here! They may be of use to us. We should help.',12,0,100,0,0,36402,''),
(70100,3,0,'This foundry should be sufficient.  We will empower the metal with an electrical charge.',12,0,100,1,0,36405,''),
(70100,4,0,'Be ready to fight if we draw too much attention.',14,0,100,0,0,36023,''),
(70100,5,0,'Excellent! The materials are prepared.  Follow me.',12,0,100,4,0,36026,''),
(70100,6,0,'How interesting! This forge is built atop of ancient Titan machinery. Lei Shen, you clever, clever tyrant, you!',12,0,100,0,0,36027,''),
(70100,7,0,'Now if I were a dwarf I would just start randomly pushing buttons. But you and I are here for a purpose.',12,0,100,0,0,36028,''),
(70100,8,0,'Look at that. How easy it must have been for Lei Shen to build an empire, for he wielded the power to create worlds.',12,0,100,0,0,36030,''),
(70100,9,0,'The mogu were using only a fraction of the resources available to them. Few among them possessed the cunning of the Thunder King.',12,0,100,0,0,36039,''),
(70100,10,0,'What\'s this - "Anomaly detected." Anomaly?',12,0,100,6,0,36040,''),
(70100,11,0,'Look at that. This old Titan technology is acting like a magnet for the sha.',12,0,100,1,0,36041,''),
(70100,12,0,'You\'re an expert at destroying sha by now. Clean up this mess!',12,0,100,396,0,36042,''),
(70100,13,0,'Perhaps if I overcharge the forge, it will destabilize this sha nuisance? Let\'s try it.',12,0,100,0,0,36406,''),
(70100,14,0,'Oh - I may have spoken too soon. The sha grows in strength! Destroy it!',12,0,100,274,0,36408,''),
(70100,15,0,'You aren\'t harboring any bad thoughts, are you?',12,0,100,0,0,36409,''),
(70100,16,0,'There! Our work is complete - we have forged a masterpiece!',12,0,100,1,0,36049,''),
(70100,17,0,'We are done here, but the weapon is not yet tempered.',12,0,100,1,0,36050,''),
(70131,0,0,'I\'ve selected a landing site on the island: high ground that\'s easily defended.',12,0,100,0,0,35526,''),
(70131,1,0,'Alas, the Zandalari trolls have already claimed and fortified it.',12,0,100,0,0,35617,''),
(70131,2,0,'They\'re protecting it with a powerful spirit barrier. We\'ll need to take it down before we can portal our troops in.',12,0,100,0,0,35528,''),
(70131,3,0,'That\'s the Alliance spirit for you - unstoppable!',12,0,100,273,0,35531,''),
(70131,4,0,'Vereesa, establish a perimeter. Modera, place the sentry wards. Narasi, begin porting in tents and supplies.',12,0,100,25,0,35532,''),
(70131,5,0,'Everyone take up positions! Enemies surround us on all sides! There is no time to waste.',12,0,100,1,0,35533,''),
(70166,0,0,'This is only what you once asked me to do if it came to this, Kanrethad. You brought this on yourself.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(70166,1,0,'Kanrethad enveloped himself with so much fel energy that it corrupted him totally. But a small taste of his power should not be harmful. Go ahead.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(70166,2,0,'Now go, and use what you\'ve learned. If you ever wish to have the fel energy purged from you, or reabsorb some of Kanrethad\'s, talk to me. I\'ll be at the Altar of Damnation in Shadowmoon Valley, keeping him banished.',12,0,100,1,0,0,''),
(70279,0,0,'Shimmer Ridge. I know it well. The Frostmane trolls breed and plot atop that snow-blown mesa.',12,0,100,273,0,37190,''),
(70279,1,0,'We\'ve lost many mountaineers to this freakish storm, or the trolls slithering about in it.',12,0,100,1,0,37191,''),
(70279,2,0,'Aye. I am loath to send my men into that. It reeks of ambush and bloody disaster.',12,0,100,273,0,37192,''),
(70279,3,0,'If they can stop that storm, I\'ll lead the Forgeguard to the top myself.',12,0,100,5,0,37193,''),
(70279,4,0,'Indeed. With the aid of your champions, the Dark Irons will put an end to the Zandalari threat in Dun Morogh.',12,0,100,1,0,37195,''),
(70279,5,0,'We will prove our loyalty - to the Council, Ironforge, and the Alliance - here, today, and with our own blood.',12,0,100,5,0,0,''),
(70279,6,0,'I\'ll see you when it\'s done, King of Stormwind.',12,0,100,2,0,37196,''),
(70279,7,0,'The king\'s champions have done it: The storm has ended! Forward, Dark Irons! TO BATTLE WE MARCH!',14,0,100,397,0,37197,''),
(70279,8,0,'That they are, King Varian. And at the service of the Alliance, I might add.',12,0,100,273,0,37198,''),
(70279,9,0,'Better they\'re grateful for the clansmen spared death on this miserable hillock. We sought to protect and impress, not to shame.',12,0,100,274,0,37199,''),
(70283,0,0,'A |cFFFF2222[Thundering Anvil]|r has become overcharged! Activate it to |cFFFF2222|Hspell:138834|h[Discharge]|h|r its energy.',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70283,1,0,'I\'ve overcharged the anvils. They will be VERY effective against the sha, but each one can only be used once more!',12,0,100,22,0,36410,''),
(70286,0,0,'Shaol\'mara Beastcaller summons raptors to his aid!',41,0,100,0,0,0,''),
(70437,0,0,'You have swept the filth from my doorstep. Perhaps you are worthy of my attention.',14,0,100,0,0,35587,'Lei shen event 1'),
(70437,1,0,'But your trespass ends here. None may enter my forbidden stronghold. I shall rebuild this bridge with your bones for bricks.',14,0,100,0,0,35588,'Lei Shen event 2'),
